@SecureGuard.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5102

### Учебное событие — ожидаем 200 OK
GET {{SecureGuard.Api_HostAddress}}/api/events/example
Accept: application/json

### Приём корректного события — ожидаем 200 OK
POST {{SecureGuard.Api_HostAddress}}/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "host": "server-02",
  "source": "ssh",
  "rawMessage": "Failed password for student from 192.168.1.20 port 50231 ssh2"
}

### Пустое имя сервера — ожидаем 400 Bad Request
POST {{SecureGuard.Api_HostAddress}}/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "host": "",
  "source": "ssh",
  "rawMessage": "Failed password for student from 192.168.1.20 port 50231 ssh2"
}
